# Audit history is local product state and there can be hundreds of files. The
# public demo image needs evidence to serve, but it should be the same evidence
# everywhere - not whatever happens to be on the machine doing the build. So:
# exclude the directory, then re-admit exactly the five runs that are committed,
# one per scenario. The image is then reproducible from a clean clone.
evidence/runs/*
!evidence/runs/README.md
!evidence/runs/20260728T174522-89d397.json
!evidence/runs/20260728T175344-81df34.json
!evidence/runs/20260729T044318-0be937.json
!evidence/runs/20260729T050141-dc73ad.json
!evidence/runs/20260729T050250-693684.json

# Raw machine reports, not deliverables.
**/*.local.json
